<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription(siteFaction==Pirate)->Pirates have established a temporary outpost near [kiiro_settlement_label] and deployed a [problemCauserLabel] inside to disrupt the residents of [kiiro_settlement_label].\n\nThe [problemCauserLabel] has been adjusted to increase power in the direction of [kiiro_settlement_label], and the kiiro residents in [kiiro_settlement_label] cannot endure the harsh conditions for too long.\n\nKiiros needs your help. Several kiiro guerrilla teams will distract the pirates at the temporary outpost, providing cover for your team to approach the [problemCauserLabel].</li>
    <li>questDescription(siteFaction==Mechanoids)->A mech cluster containing a [problemCauserLabel] was airdropped near [kiiro_settlement_label].\n\nFor unknown reasons, the [problemCauserLabel] has concentrated its power in the direction of [kiiro_settlement_label], and the kiiro residents in [kiiro_settlement_label] cannot endure the harsh conditions for too long.\n\nKiiros needs your help. A kiiro special forces team will be on standby nearby and will assist your team when the cluster is activated.</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_ProblemCauser.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription(siteFaction==Pirate)->海盗在[kiiro_settlement_label]附近建立了一个临时据点，据点内部署了一台[problemCauserLabel]以干扰[kiiro_settlement_label]中的居民。\n\n[problemCauserLabel]经过调整，在[kiiro_settlement_label]方向加强了功率，[kiiro_settlement_label]的绮罗们无法在恶劣环境的影响下坚持太久。\n\n绮罗族需要你的帮助。数支绮罗游击队会牵制住临时据点的海盗，掩护你的队伍接近[problemCauserLabel]。</li>
    <li>questDescription(siteFaction==Mechanoids)->一个含有一台[problemCauserLabel]的机械集群空投到了[kiiro_settlement_label]附近。\n\n[problemCauserLabel]因为不明原因将功率集中到了[kiiro_settlement_label]方向，[kiiro_settlement_label]的绮罗们无法在恶劣环境的影响下坚持太久。\n\n绮罗族需要你的帮助。一支绮罗特战小组会在附近待命并负责在集群被激活时接应你的队伍。</li>
  </Kiiro_ProblemCauser.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName(siteFaction==Pirate)->[problemCauserLabel] threat</li>
    <li>questName(siteFaction==Mechanoids)->[problemCauserLabel] threat</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_ProblemCauser.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName(siteFaction==Pirate)->[problemCauserLabel]威胁</li>
    <li>questName(siteFaction==Mechanoids)->[problemCauserLabel]威胁</li>
  </Kiiro_ProblemCauser.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: Quest failed：[problemCauserLabel] -->
  <Kiiro_ProblemCauser.root.nodes.QuestEndUnfinished.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>任务失败：[problemCauserLabel]</Kiiro_ProblemCauser.root.nodes.QuestEndUnfinished.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The kiiro residents of [kiiro_settlement_label], who could no longer bear the influence of [problemCauserLabel], have decided to evacuate.\n\n[kiiro_settlement_label] has been abandoned. -->
  <Kiiro_ProblemCauser.root.nodes.QuestEndUnfinished.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>再也无法承受[problemCauserLabel]影响的[kiiro_settlement_label]的绮罗居民们决定搬离。\n\n[kiiro_settlement_label]被废弃了。</Kiiro_ProblemCauser.root.nodes.QuestEndUnfinished.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [problemCauserLabel] destroyed -->
  <Kiiro_ProblemCauser.root.nodes.conditionCauserDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>已摧毁[problemCauserLabel]</Kiiro_ProblemCauser.root.nodes.conditionCauserDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: You have successfully destroyed the [problemCauserLabel] that was affecting [kiiro_settlement_label]! Your relationship with kiiros has increased by [goodWillRewardAbs]. -->
  <Kiiro_ProblemCauser.root.nodes.conditionCauserDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你成功摧毁了正在影响[kiiro_settlement_label]的[problemCauserLabel]！与绮罗族的关系增加了[goodWillRewardAbs]。</Kiiro_ProblemCauser.root.nodes.conditionCauserDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
</LanguageData>